	"threatinc_frontOverrunMusterDays": 10,
	# a defending colony's stance (2026-10-17): Push counter-attacks on the
	# cadence, Dig in holds fire and earns frontEntrenchDefenseBonus on its
	# defence over frontEntrenchDays; a district lost keeps this fraction of
